{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09273","headline":"晚归沣川 · 韦应物","name":"晚归沣川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凌雾朝阊阖，落日返清川。\n簪组方暂解，临水一翛然。\n昆弟忻来集，童稚满眼前。\n适意在无事，携手望秋田。\n南岭横爽气，高林绕遥阡。\n野庐不锄理，翳翳起荒烟。\n名秩斯逾分，廉退媿不全。\n已想平门路，晨骑复言旋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}